. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
. * here, we regress the index of gender attitudes on the number of daughters a
> nd controls. A positive coefficient
. * for the number of daughters suggests that parents with female children have
>  attitudes that are stronger in favor of gender equality.
. 
. reg gender_attitude num_daughters male age age2 i.num_children if num_childre
> n > 0, vce(robust)

